","name":"轰雷","nameEn":"Thunder Bombardment","maxLevel":10,"desc":"攻击目标，造成导电伤害。","descEn":"Attack the target, dealing Electro DMG.","params":[{"label":"技能伤害","labelEn":"Skill DMG","values":["32.00%","34.63%","37.25%","40.93%","43.55%","46.57%","50.77%","54.96%","59.16%","63.62%"]},{"label":"回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Concerto Regen","values":["10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10"]}],"hits":[{"label":"技能伤害","labelEn":"Skill DMG","term":0,"count":1,"multiplier":[0.32,0.3463,0.3725,0.4093,0.4355,0.4657,0.5077,0.5496,0.5916,0.6362],"damageId":1303600002,"type":"intro","typeId":3,"typeName":"变奏技能","calc":"damage","element":"electro","elementId":3,"scaling":"def","rateField":"RateLv","flat":null,"energy":[10.0],"concerto":[0.0],"elementPowerType":0,"toughness":[1.587],"offTune":[1.2696],"hardness":[1.0],"formulaType":0,"subType":[],"damageIds":[1303600002],"confidence":"high"}],"concertoGain":10.0,"confidence":"high","skillIcon":"assets/skills/1001606.webp?v=cfea530ca101"},{"id":1001607,"type":6,"typeName":"共鸣回路","typeNameEn":"Forte Circuit","name":"沉雷藏锋","nameEn":"Unassuming Blade","maxLevel":10,"desc":"万壑雷\n 【锋芒】充满时，长按共鸣技能，将会消耗所有【锋芒】，施放万壑雷，造成导电伤害，并使渊武进入雷厉风行状态。\n \n掀雷\n【锋芒】充满时，共鸣技能雷之楔将会施放掀雷，造成导电伤害。\n \n 雷厉风行\n 在雷厉风行状态下的角色抗打断能力提升。\n 渊武处于该状态下时：\n ·普攻的攻击范围扩大，削减怪物共振度的能力提升；\n ·重击的攻击更为迅猛，削减怪物共振度的能力提升；\n ·闪避反击的攻击更为迅猛，削减怪物共振度的能力提升；\n ·施放重击或成功触发逆势回击后3秒内短按普攻，将会施放蹑风追雷攻击目标，造成导电伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害；\n ·不会回复【锋芒】。\n  \n 锋芒获取规则\n 【锋芒】上限100点。\n 场上存在共鸣技能雷之楔时，每秒回复6点【锋芒】，渊武不在场时该效果依然生效。\n 共鸣技能雷之楔协同攻击命中目标时，回复5点【锋芒】。","descEn":"Rumbling Spark\nWhen \"Readiness\" is full, hold Resonance Skill to consume all \"Readiness\" and cast Rumbling Spark, dealing Electro DMG and entering the Lightning Infused state.\n\nThunder Uprising\nWhen \"Readiness\" is full, Resonance Skill Thunder Wedge will be replaced with Thunder Uprising, dealing Electro DMG.\n\nLightning Infused\nThe character in Lightning Infused state has a greatly increased resistance to interruption.\nWhen Yuanwu is in this state:\n-Basic Attacks: Hit targets in a larger range, reduce enemy Vibration Strength with increased efficiency.\n-Heavy Attacks: Have increased attack speed, reduce enemy Vibration Strength with increased efficiency.\n-Dodge Counters: Have increased attack speed, reduce enemy Vibration Strength with increased efficiency.\n-Use Basic Attack within 3s after casting a Heavy Attack or a successful Counterattack to cast Thunderweaver, dealing Electro DMG, considered as Basic Attack DMG.\n-Does not recover \"Readiness\".\n\nReadiness\nYuanwu can hold up to 100 \"Readiness\".\nWhen Resonance Skill Thunder Wedge is on the field, Yuanwu gains 6 \"Readiness\" every second, even when he is not the active character;\nWhen Resonance Skill Thunder Wedge hits a target with a Coordinated Attack, Yuanwu gains 5 \"Readiness\".","params":[{"label":"掀雷伤害","labelEn":"Thunder Uprising Damage","values":["20.00%","21.64%","23.28%","25.58%","27.22%","29.11%","31.73%","34.35%","36.98%","39.77%"]},{"label":"雷厉风行普攻第一段伤害","labelEn":"Lightning Infused Basic Attack Stage 1 DMG","values":["12.35%","13.37%","14.38%","15.80%","16.81%","17.98%","19.60%","21.22%","22.84%","24.56%"]},{"label":"雷厉风行普攻第二段伤害","labelEn":"Lightning Infused Basic Attack Stage 2 DMG","values":["13.03%*2","14.10%*2","15.17%*2","16.67%*2","17.73%*2","18.96%*2","20.67%*2","22.38%*2","24.09%*2","25.91%*2"]},{"label":"雷厉风行普攻第三段伤害","labelEn":"Lightning Infused Basic Attack Stage 3 DMG","values":["5.50%*2+8.24%*2","5.95%*2+8.92%*2","6.40%*2+9.59%*2","7.03%*2+10.54%*2","7.48%*2+11.21%*2","8.00%*2+11.99%*2","8.72%*2+13.07%*2","9.44%*2+14.15%*2","10.16%*2+15.23%*2","10.92%*2+16.38%*2"]},{"label":"雷厉风行普攻第四段伤害","labelEn":"Lightning Infused Basic Attack Stage 4 DMG","values":["5.77%*5","6.24%*5","6.71%*5","7.38%*5","7.85%*5","8.39%*5","9.15%*5","9.90%*5","10.66%*5","11.46%*5"]},{"label":"雷厉风行普攻第五段伤害","labelEn":"Lightning Infused Basic Attack Stage 5 DMG","values":["8.24%*3+16.47%","8.91%*3+17.82%","9.59%*3+19.17%","10.53%*3+21.06%","11.21%*3+22.41%","11.